# The attract demo's flight (1.5): Coral Reach from the demo's fixed start (the theatre
# loaded fresh, classic steering, difficulty 3, seed 0xACE1, frame 256): take off from the
# carrier, fly to the nearest factory, drop its bombs, hang there and watch it burn.
# Counted in frames. NOT run by `agk test` (it needs that fixed state): converted by
#   python3 ~/amiga-game-kit/techniques/attract/tools/scen2demo.py tools/demoflight.agk > src/demodata.c
